*.raw
*.log
__pycache__/
.DS_Store

# sim/ harness: the raw ngspice logs under corners/ (one per PVT point) and
# mc-draws/ (one per Monte Carlo draw and per negative-control draw) are
# committed evidence -- the append-only record trail, see sim/README.md -- so
# they escape the *.log rule above.
!sim/*/corners/**/*.log
!sim/*/mc-draws/**/*.log
# sim/sar-sequencer-behavioral/ (issue #55): a standalone behavioral
# testbench outside the shared PVT/MC harness (see that experiment's own
# run_testbench.py module docstring), whose raw ngspice transient log is
# committed evidence the same way corners/ and mc-draws/ are above.
!sim/*/runs/*.log
# harness scratch: regenerated netlists and generated corner decks. The
# runners themselves simulate in a TemporaryDirectory and only copy the
# resulting logs back under sim/<experiment>/, so this only catches
# interactive/xschem scratch (see sim/xschemrc's netlist_dir).
sim/build/
# ngspice model-check scratch dumps (e.g. bsim4v5.out) from ad hoc ngspice
# invocations at repo root. Root-anchored so it doesn't clobber unrelated
# *.out files elsewhere in the tree -- notably sim/smoke_test.ngspice.out,
# which IS committed evidence (see sim/README.md "Bootstrap smoke test").
/*.out

# layout/ DRC/LVS flow: local klt install, created by layout/bin/setup-venv.sh
layout/.venv/
# layout/sar-sequencer/ (issue #102): generate-lvs-reference.py's own output
# -- regenerated per run-flow.sh run from that run's post-route netlist, and
# copied into each timestamped reports/<record-id>/ (the committed evidence
# trail) -- so the top-level copy is scratch, not a tracked source file.
layout/sar-sequencer/reference/
# layout/comparator/pex/ (issue #112): `klt sim`/`klt extract`'s own scratch
# directory, written next to whatever file it was invoked against (a
# request JSON, a layout GDS) unless `--outdir` overrides it -- per-corner
# logs/decks, not evidence. `run_pex.py` cleans its own report-dir copy up
# at the end of a successful `--record` run; this is defense-in-depth for
# an interactive `klt sim`/`klt pex` invocation or an interrupted run.
layout/comparator/**/.klt/
